# W7h, host a (k5): hosts in stag0101 with b; the proxy holds his packets from @197 for 50 s (a half-open link: his grace starts
# after 4 s of silence); back at @247 he catches up and sees c, who joined meanwhile.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@80
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log a hosts
wander -150 -60 20 until present=2,sealed>=600
log b joined
idle until epoch>=@190
idle until epoch>=@250
log a back
idle until present=3 fail epoch>=@330
log a sees c
wander -150 -60 20 until epoch>=@345 fail stage=stagml11
log a played on as host
